<BaseLayout title="About — Justin Tahai" description="About Justin Tahai, IT Engineer, Web Developer, and builder."><header class="page-intro"><span class="eyebrow">About the builder</span><h1>Experience and<br />the system beneath it.</h1><p>I am Justin Tahai: an IT Engineer and Web Developer focused on durable public experiences, operational clarity, and technical work people can actually use.</p></header><article class="prose"><h2>How I work</h2><p>I start with the route a person needs to take, then work inward: content, interface, delivery, boundaries, and the handoff that makes the next change possible. The right tool is the one that makes the real constraint easier to manage.</p><h2>Business context</h2><p><strong>MAINELY CODE LLC</strong> is the company behind its own product work. <strong>TAHAI Web Services</strong> is my personal DBA for services and related technical work. They are distinct contexts, with their own public destinations and promises.</p><div class="two-up">{routes.map(route => <article class="route-card"><span class="eyebrow">{route.detail}</span><h3>{route.label}</h3><a href={route.href}>{route.href.replace('https://','')} →</a></article>)}</div><h2 id="contact">Talk about a project</h2><p>For public work, technical collaboration, or a web/system problem that needs a clear route forward, connect through <a href="https://tahai.net/contact/">TAHAI Web Services</a> or <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/justintahai/">LinkedIn</a>.</p></article></BaseLayout>
